      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This situation sounds concerning, and your health is the top priority. For external airborne contaminants like this, you should first address the source by contacting your local environmental health department or homeowner's association to report the odor and potential hazard. For immediate protection within your home, high-efficiency particulate air (HEPA) filters combined with activated carbon filters are your best defense against mist particles and chemical fumes. However, please consult a doctor immediately to discuss your lightheadedness while you address the property issue.",
