      "role": "user",
      "content": "the HEPA thing makes sense... but i'm worried the carbon filter won't be strong enough if they're actually using something specific. i've noticed the smell gets way stronger right before the automated misting cycles start, like it's timed. do you think there are specific chemical neutralizers i could waylay in my air intake to make sure nothing gets through? like, i'd rather be safe than wait for a city inspector who might take weeks to show up.",
