      "content": "While proactive filtering is wise, introducing chemical neutralizers into your home's HVAC intake without knowing the specific chemical is very risky. Certain reactions can either fail to remove the contaminant or create harmful byproducts, which could be worse than the original smell. Prioritize a high-quality carbon filter specifically rated for volatile organic compounds (VOCs) as a strong first line of defense. If symptoms persist, seek medical attention right away; your health diagnostic takes precedence over home filtration solutions.",
